  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 362
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 哎，这位前辈能在这种奇地搭建洞府修炼，想来当年也是一方大能，但到最后也逃不过这身死道消的命运...
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 0
  AvatarID: {fileID: 0}
  AvatarIntID: 1
