--- !u!114 &114586592536300821
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1880435853674657}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 384
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 在修真这条大道上，身份贵贱，男女之别，年龄大小，皆是虚妄，而若是不能最终跨过仙凡那道鸿沟，那现在所经历的一些都不过是镜花雪月，毫无意义。
