--- !u!114 &114824552582508936
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1880435853674657}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 305
  indentLevel: 1
  storyText: 你平日里虽也修行过一些炼体法门，但不甚精通。又走不到百米，风势渐涨，你也开始感到力不从心，只能勉强用灵力护住周身不被罡风刮伤，确是难以继续前进了。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
  AvatarID: {fileID: 0}
  AvatarIntID: 0
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &114865966599044290
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1880435853674657}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 310
  indentLevel: 1
  storyText: 你一口气冲过裂缝，发现自己已经来到了一个地下溶洞之中。身后还能听到呼啸的风声，而洞窟中却平静的很，不到百米的距离却仿佛进入了另外一个世界。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
  AvatarID: {fileID: 0}
  AvatarIntID: 0
